{"ts":"2026-09-03T19:55:26.563Z","author":"pi-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.2:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"605ea5f6680865c84dd5507b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.2:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-09-03T19:55:26.563Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-09-03T19:55:26.563Z","author":"pi-agent","text":"Three P1 findings closed on scripts/shell-command-scan.ts and scripts/verify-release-publish-attestation.ts:\n\nFinding 1 (Closed-block bindings become visible again): Block closers lowered lineDepth without removing bindings from the scope stack. A later independent block reopening at the same depth satisfied binding.depth <= lineDepth again, attesting a publish the shell never would. Fix: pop bindings whose depth exceeds the new lineDepth when a block closer fires.\n\nFinding 2 (Later assignments rewrite earlier commands): All same-line assignments were loaded before the line was expanded, so npm publish $FLAG; FLAG=--provenance rewrote the earlier publish to carry the flag. Fix: split the line on unquoted ; and ;; (splitLineSegments), load same-line assignments per segment by offset, and expand each segment in order.\n\nFinding 3 (One-line branches lose their scope): if false; then FLAG=--provenance; fi has net depth change zero, so the assignment was recorded at the outer scope. Fix: track blockDepthChange and caseDepthChange per segment in scalarAssignments, so the assignment gets the inner depth.\n\nEach fix was verified by reverting only that fix and running the full suite: 263 pass / 1 fail (the new witness) in each case, 264/0 with all three restored. Three new paired tests added, each with a mirror that must stay green."}]}],"before_hash":"385997cc9e25b9f188b26c8a5489ef7e3ef48f16d1c4320586add08f5987d883","after_hash":"68618c97fc13bbe83ad74234869875c579231a4b58f900554f1048c3f6d81008","item_hash_version":2}
